=== Customer Feedback Analyzer ===

# Customer Feedback Analysis Report

## 1. Key Themes & Sentiment Patterns

| Theme | Sentiment | Frequency | Impact |
|-------|-----------|-----------|--------|
| **Product Quality** | Positive | High | Core strength |
| **Delivery/Logistics** | Negative | Medium | Operational issue |
| **Customer Support** | Positive | High | Competitive advantage |
| **Technical Performance** | Negative | Medium | User experience blocker |
| **UI/UX Design** | Mixed | Medium | Usability concern |

**Overall Pattern:** Strong product-market fit with operational and technical execution gaps

---

## 2. Critical Issues (Immediate Action Required)

### 🔴 **Priority 1: App Stability**
- **Issue:** Frequent crashes (2/5 rating)
- **Impact:** High—directly affects user retention
- **Action Items:**
  - Conduct crash log analysis within 48 hours
  - Identify top 3 crash scenarios
  - Release hotfix patch within 1-2 weeks
  - Implement automated crash reporting

### 🟠 **Priority 2: Delivery Speed**
- **Issue:** Slow fulfillment (mentioned in 4/5 survey)
- **Impact:** Medium—affects customer satisfaction despite product quality
- **Action Items:**
  - Audit current delivery timeline vs. customer expectations
  - Identify bottlenecks (inventory, shipping, processing)
  - Set target delivery SLA
  - Communicate improvements to


